It depends. The Castle generally wants magic resistance. The C Quest
Nemesis is jolly buff. I would clean out Medusa now, an easy choice.

Ludious is not very tough if you have reflection - which you do - since
nearly all the monsters must fight you in choke points. OTOH as you
observe Ludious offers little reward for someone with maxed protection,
but there's bound to be a good chance of some loot; there's a throne,
opportunities to make DSM if you need it, a whole heap of soldier-loot -
and if it's safe, you may as well check it now.

The first levels of the Caveman quest can be scummed for giants in order
to max out your Str. May as well do that now.

